"The issuer's endpoints, bound to one :class:`~pyevp.issuer.Issuer` or "
"chosen per request."
msgstr ""

#: of pyevp.contrib.django.issuer.IssuerSite:3
msgid ""
"the issuer to serve.  Leave it out and override :meth:`get_issuer` when "
"it depends on the request, e.g. on the host."
msgstr ""

#: of pyevp.contrib.django.issuer.IssuerSite:5
msgid ""
"where Chrome sends users who are not signed in; defaults to "
"``settings.LOGIN_URL``.  A path is taken relative to the issuer's origin."
msgstr ""

#: of pyevp.contrib.django.issuer.IssuerSite:8
msgid ""
":attr:`urls` must be included at the root of the issuer's origin, and the"
" paths below must match the issuer's ``issuance_endpoint`` and "
